WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.105
Step 1. Open the appointment.

1.2
00:00:02.105 --> 00:00:06.519
Starting a consultation opens or creates the appointment's encounter.

1.3
00:00:06.519 --> 00:00:09.653
Select the appointment on the Appointments board,

1.4
00:00:09.653 --> 00:00:12.392
and Care shows Appointment Details.

2.1
00:00:12.392 --> 00:00:16.588
Step 2. Select Start Consultation, under Quick Actions.

2.2
00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:19.960
No encounter is linked to this appointment yet,

2.3
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.688
so the Initiate Patient Encounter form opens.

3.1
00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:28.576
Step 3. Check the encounter form. Care sets Status to In Progress.

3.2
00:00:28.576 --> 00:00:31.809
Choose the type of encounter, here Ambulatory,

3.3
00:00:31.809 --> 00:00:35.823
and make sure at least one department is selected.

4.1
00:00:35.823 --> 00:00:39.698
Step 4. Create the encounter. Select Create Encounter.

4.2
00:00:39.698 --> 00:00:44.398
Care creates the encounter, links it to the appointment, and opens it,

4.3
00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:47.315
with the appointment bar at the top.

5.1
00:00:47.315 --> 00:00:50.142
Step 5. Check the appointment's status.

5.2
00:00:50.142 --> 00:00:55.493
With permission to update bookings, Care sets the appointment to In-Consultation.

5.3
00:00:55.493 --> 00:01:00.288
Appointment Details now shows the encounter, with View Encounter.
